# thriveOS: execute a queued thrive power-control request (#39). Triggered by
# thrive-power.path (not enabled directly). Runs as root so it can reboot/poweroff
# and bounce the stack/kiosk; the executor consumes the request file each run.
[Unit]
Description=Execute a queued thrive power-control request (#39)

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/thrive-power
